===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|or}}; partially contracted from {{m|enm|other}}, {{m|enm|auther}}, from {{inh|en|ang|āþor}}, {{m|ang|āwþer}}, {{m|ang|āhwæþer}} {{gloss|"some, any, either"; > {{l|en|either}}}}; and partially from {{inh|en|enm|oththe}}, from {{inh|en|ang|oþþe}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*efþau||or}}.

